    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">It looks like you&#39;re installing from source. Are you doing that on purpose? The default on Windows is to install from binaries, which should work for you. (If you want to install from source you would need to install <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392491623000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1AGQY30yNCBZq7z5oxoQIK\">Rtools</a>)<div><br></div><div>If you have an option set to install from source (getOption(&quot;pkgType&quot;) is &quot;source&quot;) you can override that with options(pkgType = &quot;binary&quot;).</div></div>"
    ],
    [
